issariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149491835375616541398.jpeg/jUfI0s3rQxiR-WMelRz4ymc9Apohc12bIGuLFyBrixc\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149495270641664378025.jpeg/goZ94OshX__ktBBySdU416mynIIpxiWXI0ce8iNHHvI\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149498357780480342705.jpeg/GLH9B6S7YxP15nbZn7Dy1_oya2H-RoW7qY0DramNA60\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><p>墨球員出手相助　韓選手一舉動惹怒網友</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-22T15:38:29.317361+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1944,"images":29,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}